cosmic-radio (0.2.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * MPRIS2 support: now-playing metadata (title, artist, stream URL, artwork),
    playback status, and media controls (play, pause, stop, play-pause) for
    integration with other desktop media applications.
  * Volume control from MPRIS clients.
  * Clippy lint fixes.

 -- Adam Balestone <stonehouse.adam@gmail.com>  Sat, 15 Aug 2026 22:48:02 +0100

cosmic-radio (0.1.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for Pop OS.
  * Internet radio streaming applet for the COSMIC desktop.
  * Station management via TOML configuration.
  * Now-playing metadata display and artwork caching.
  * PLS playlist support and "Play from URL" feature.

